OL,3,GNEWSA'He was a crime scene,' say
OL,4,Abereaved parents recalling son's final
OL,5,Amoments
OL,6,
OL,7,FYvette Bullen was working a shift at
OL,8,Fthe Morrisons supermarket in Seaford
OL,9,Fwhen she received a phone call.
OL,11,FIt was the mother of the girlfriend of
OL,12,Fher son Josh Ingram, telling her he had
OL,13,Fbeen stabbed.
OL,15,F"I dropped everything, flew out of work
OL,16,Fto see him on laying on a stretcher in
OL,17,Fthe road with them working on him," she
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,FJosh, 16, had been attacked at the
OL,21,Fnearby railway station on 10 September
OL,22,F2025.
